Package: autodarts-headless-control
Version: 1.0.0
Section: utils
Priority: optional
Architecture: all
Depends: python3 (>= 3.10), python3-venv, network-manager, dnsmasq-base, avahi-daemon, avahi-utils, ufw, iw, iproute2, curl, ca-certificates, polkitd | policykit-1
Maintainer: Autodarts Headless Control <https://github.com/xXxecutor/autodarts-headless-control>
Homepage: https://github.com/xXxecutor/autodarts-headless-control
Description: Headless control and web management for Autodarts
 Reliable browser-based control for Autodarts on Linux mini-PCs
 and single-board computers (Raspberry Pi, x86_64, ARM64).
 Provides web interface, WiFi management with hotspot fallback,
 systemd integration and Autodarts autostart without monitor or keyboard.
